            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method of manufacturing a display device, the method comprising: providing a dam on a carrier substrate; providing a first display part at one side of the dam and providing a second display part at the other side of the dam; and removing the carrier substrate, wherein one of the first display part and the second display part is transparent, and the other of the first display part and the second display part is opaque.</p>
